{%- doc -%}
  Font Awesome Kit loader (FA 6/7). Separate ownership from the theme —
  paste your kit ID in Theme settings → Icons → Font Awesome kit ID.

  Setup:
  1. Create a kit at https://fontawesome.com/kits (Web Fonts + CSS or SVG + JS).
  2. Copy the kit ID from the embed URL: kit.fontawesome.com/<KIT_ID>.js
  3. Paste <KIT_ID> into Theme settings → Icons → Font Awesome kit ID
     (or set `settings.font_awesome_kit_id` in the editor).
  4. Use icons: <i class="fa-solid fa-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i>

  Leave the setting blank to skip the script (no remote request).
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fa_kit_id = settings.font_awesome_kit_id | default: '' | strip
-%}

{%- if fa_kit_id != blank -%}
  <script
    src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/{{ fa_kit_id | escape }}.js"
    crossorigin="anonymous"
    defer
  ></script>
{%- else -%}
  {% comment %}
    Font Awesome inactive — paste kit ID in Theme settings → Icons.
    Placeholder: REPLACE_WITH_FA_KIT_ID (e.g. a1b2c3d4e5 from kit.fontawesome.com/a1b2c3d4e5.js).
  {% endcomment %}
{%- endif -%}
